  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6e5fb75f-3a13-5767-bacc-4c23aa5cee2f" activityNameId="b2797edb-157b-5349-a138-b95235ecd950" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dimethylamine, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dimethylamine, at plant
The process "dimethylamine, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of dimethylamine from methanol in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
Formula: C2H7N; 
UUID: aa8294c2-6270-3b56-861c-676b1f7f35bd
Production of dimethylamine including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Reaction of methanol with ammonia
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production of ethylamines  in the world  is around 30.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aa8294c2-6270-3b56-861c-676b1f7f35bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
